{"id":"098eb0fb573e","publishedAt":1795604204000,"posts":[[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/nikoniko_style/imgs/1/2/12016e69.jpg"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"【引用画像】出典：『とある科学の超電磁砲T』"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"1 "},{"size":10,"text":"2026/11/25(水)"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\nとある科学の佐天さんってなんで人気だったの？　　"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\n雑魚ガキだよ "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"2 "},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\n無能力者なのに能力者に立ち向かう友を見捨てない強い心が覚醒して最強能力者になったのがリアル世界で雑魚の奴らの理想だから "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"4 "},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\nは？何？　　"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"3 "},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\n可愛いから "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"5 "},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\n可愛いから "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"6 "},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\nとある科学の女　　 "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"7 "},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\nうーいーはーるー係 "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"9 "},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"\nぱい "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"11 "},{"br":1},{"size":24,"color":"#CC3333","text":"\n珍しく言動がまともなキャラだったから\n"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/nikoniko_style/imgs/1/f/1f378aca.jpg"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"color":"#CC3333","text":"【引用画像】出典：『とある科学の超電磁砲T』"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"\n引用元\n"},{"size":10,"text":"https://viper.2ch.sc/test/read.cgi/news4vip/1795579943/"}]],"comments":[]}